---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Imprint" description="Legal notice (Impressum) of Planexus GmbH — information pursuant to Section 5 of the German Telemedia Act (TMG). Laboratory containers and modular construction specialist based in Albstadt." canonical="/en/imprint">
  <div class="pt-20 min-h-screen bg-white">
    <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50 border-b border-gray-100">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 text-center">Imprint</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-16">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-lg prose-slate">

          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8 text-sm leading-relaxed bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-gray-100">
            This English translation of the legal notice (Impressum) is provided for convenience. The <a href="/impressum" class="font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">German version</a> is legally authoritative.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Information pursuant to Section 5 TMG</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4 text-sm">
            The following information is provided pursuant to Section 5 of the German Telemedia Act (Telemediengesetz – TMG).
          </p>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-xl mb-8">
            <p class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2">Planexus GmbH</p>
            <p class="text-gray-600">
              Am Steinbach 8<br />
              72459 Albstadt<br />
              Germany
            </p>
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Represented by</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
            Managing Directors: Sven Biewald &amp; Thomas Boss
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Contact</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
            Telephone: <a href="tel:+4974357519700" class="text-primary hover:underline">+49 7435 7519 700</a><br />
            Email: <a href="mailto:info@planexus.de" class="text-primary hover:underline">info@planexus.de</a>
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Commercial register entry</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
            Entered in the Commercial Register (Handelsregister)<br />
            Register court: Stuttgart Local Court (Amtsgericht Stuttgart)<br />
            Register number: HRB 799338
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">VAT identification number</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">
            VAT identification number pursuant to Section 27a of the German VAT Act (Umsatzsteuergesetz):<br />
            <strong>DE454507127</strong>
          </p>

          <hr class="my-8 border-gray-200" />

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Disclaimer</h2>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Liability for content</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
            As a service provider we are responsible for our own content on these pages in accordance with Section 7(1) TMG and general legislation. Under Sections 8 to 10 TMG, however, we as a service provider are not obliged to monitor transmitted or stored third-party information or to investigate circumstances that indicate unlawful activity. Obligations to remove or block the use of information under general legislation remain unaffected. Liability in this respect is only possible from the time we become aware of a specific infringement. Upon becoming aware of such infringements, we will remove the content concerned without delay.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Liability for links</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
            Our offering contains links to external third-party websites over whose content we have no influence. We therefore cannot accept any liability for this third-party content. The respective provider or operator of the linked pages is always responsible for their content. The linked pages were checked for possible legal infringements at the time of linking. Unlawful content was not apparent at that time. Permanent monitoring of the content of linked pages is not reasonable without concrete indications of an infringement. Upon becoming aware of legal infringements, we will remove such links without delay.
          </p>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Copyright</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
            Content and works created by the site operator on these pages are subject to German copyright law. Reproduction, processing, distribution and any form of commercial use beyond the limits of copyright require the written consent of the respective author or creator. Downloads and copies of this site are permitted only for private, non-commercial use. Where content on this site was not created by the operator, third-party copyright is respected. In particular, third-party content is identified as such. Should you nevertheless become aware of a copyright infringement, please notify us accordingly. Upon becoming aware of legal infringements, we will remove such content without delay.
          </p>

          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 mt-12">
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Learn more <a href="/en/about" class="font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">about Planexus</a> or get in <a href="/en/contact" class="font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">contact</a> with us directly. Information on data protection is available in our <a href="/en/privacy" class="font-semibold text-slate-900 hover:text-primary transition-colors">privacy policy</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
